%description:
Tests a TCP Fast Open connection that sends nothing. Connection 1 caches the
cookie of the server. Connection 2 asks for Fast Open with the cookie, so its
SYN waits for the first SEND, but no SEND comes. When the connection
establishment timer expires (75 s after the open), the SYN goes out without
data, with the cookie (RFC 7413 allows it), and the handshake completes.
Before the timer expires, no SYN goes out.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
sim-time-limit = 76s
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true
*.srv_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.srv_app.localPort2=2000

*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
cli_tcp: INIT --> SYN_SENT  (on OPEN_ACTIVE)
srv_tcp: INIT --> LISTEN  (on OPEN_PASSIVE)
[75.501 A003] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP FastOpen(cookieLen=8)
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
